      "instruction": "Add 10 mL of 95 % ethanol (70 % ethanol may also be used; Catalog #BE-BDH1156, P212121), vortex or stir until the chloramphenicol is completely dissolved, yielding a 25–50 mg/mL stock solution, and store the stock at –20 °C for up to 1 year.",
